  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  text: 'THIRD TRANSIT WORKER VANISHES ON LINE 4

    Rosa Mendez, 31, is the third maintenance worker in five weeks to disappear during a night shift. MTA officials dismissed staff reports of ''something wrapped up in the tunnels'' as stress.'
